OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785341919
OL,3,CTeen motorcyclist named as victim of
OL,4,Cfatal collision as murder probe
OL,5,Claunched
OL,7,FKent Police have launched a murder
OL,8,Finvestigation following the death of
OL,9,FHarley Seal.
OL,11,FThe incident happened on Chestfield
OL,12,FRoad in Whitstable shortly before
OL,13,F8.15pm on Friday 24 July 2026.
OL,15,FThe 18-year-old was riding a
OL,16,Fmotorcycle and died at the scene
OL,17,Ffollowing a collision with a white
OL,18,FMercedes A180.
OL,20,FHis next of kin has been informed.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/4
