OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F387A1785341919
OL,3,CTeen motorcyclist named as victim of
OL,4,Cfatal collision as murder probe
OL,5,Claunched
OL,7,FPolice say: "At 9.50pm an 18-year-old
OL,8,Fman attended Canterbury police station
OL,9,Fvoluntarily and was arrested in
OL,10,Fconnection with the incident.
OL,12,F"He has since been released on bail
OL,13,Fwhilst the investigation continues.
OL,15,F"The following day, a 19-year-old man
OL,16,Fattended Canterbury Police station and
OL,17,Fwas also arrested in connection with
OL,18,Fthe incident."
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/4
